1
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,000
Food for Table 3.

2
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,880
Hurry up!

3
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,520
Hurry up!

4
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,640
I'm applying for a job.

5
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,320
How old are you?

6
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,200
Nineteen.

7
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,680
So, what can you do?

8
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,840
Recite poetry.

9
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:58,440
Ten years, a vast gulf between life and death.

10
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:01,160
I try not to think, yet it's hard to forget.

11
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,280
A lonely grave a thousand miles away.

12
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,400
Stop, stop, stop.

13
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,000
What is all this?

14
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,280
All this talk about death and graves.

15
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,000
It's bad luck.

16
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,160
Can you carry plates?

17
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:17,360
I often help my mom serve food at home.

18
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:20,800
Go back to work.

19
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,040
For Table 3.

20
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,320
Let's give you a try.

21
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,680
Take this dish...

22
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,080
...and serve it to Table 3.

23
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,520
Oh my god!

24
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:45,680
I'm sorry.

25
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,640
Sorry, sorry.

26
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,520
I'm really sorry.

27
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,000
I'm so sorry.

28
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,400
Don't bother cleaning.

29
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,480
You're wasting my time.

30
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,680
Get out, get out!

31
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,760
Yangyang wants to work!

32
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,120
Yangyang wants to earn money for Mom!

33
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,000
Get out, you Dumbass!

34
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,880
Get out!

35
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,560
Get the hell out!

36
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,120
Get lost!

37
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,040
Get out!

38
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,720
I'm sorry.

39
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,560
I can...

40
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,760
recite the menu.

41
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,200
Scrambled Eggs.

42
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,520
Shredded Pork in Garlic Sauce.

43
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,520
Sliced Beef and Offal in Chili Sauce.

44
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,680
Mapo Tofu.

45
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,080
Stop, stop, stop.

46
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,280
Stop reciting.

47
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,400
This is a restaurant.

48
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,600
I'm not running an orphanage.

49
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,160
I don't hire retards like you!

50
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,040
Yangyang is not a retard!

51
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,360
Yangyang is not a retard!

52
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:34,400
Sliced Pork with Garlic, Braised Pork Ribs

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:37,200
Dry-Fried Green Beans, Ants Climbing a Tree

54
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:39,760
Hot and Sour Shredded Potatoes, Maoxuewang

55
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:42,400
Griddle Pork Intestines, Steamed Pork Ribs

56
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,760
Poached Beef, Ants Climbing a Tree

57
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,320
Hot and Sour Shredded Potatoes, Maoxuewang

58
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,200
Griddle Pork Intestines, Steamed Pork Ribs

59
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,960
Poached Beef, Dongpo Braised Pork Hock

60
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,080
Stir-Fried Pork, Pickled Pepper Bullfrog

61
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,640
Cold Tossed fish mint, Tiger Skin Peppers

62
00:03:57,640 --> 00:04:00,640
Stir-Fried Water Spinach, Bacon with Garlic Sprouts

63
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:03,080
Tofu Pudding with Rice, Stewed Mutton with Radish

64
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:06,640
Tomato and Egg Stir-Fry, Shredded Pork in Garlic Sauce

65
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:10,360
Sliced Beef and Offal in Chili Sauce, Spicy Tofu

66
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:13,480
Poached Beef, Dongpo Braised Pork Hock

67
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:15,880
Stir-Fried Pork, Pickled Pepper Bullfrog

68
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,120
Cold Tossed fish mint!

69
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,480
Wu Huilian!

70
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,160
I finally caught you!

71
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,760
You, come here right now!

72
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,800
What the hell is that guy you introduced to me?

73
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:34,200
"The most stylish man for miles around"?

74
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:36,760
All show and no substance. He's just an idiot!

75
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,040
I'm so pissed!

76
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:45,440
A Min, why are you two together?

77
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,000
It's Yangyang's birthday.

78
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,960
I came to help.

79
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,000
I'll go wash the vegetables.

80
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,880
Go on inside, A Min.

81
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:00,760
What's going on?

82
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,720
Don't interrupt me.

83
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,360
Just calm down.

84
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:07,440
Blind dates can't be good every single time.

85
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,120
I just can't let this go.

86
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,120
Sit down, sit down.

87
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,200
Sit down for what?

88
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,160
Sit down for what?

89
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:13,640
Listen to me.

90
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:14,840
Sit down for what?

91
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,800
Let me tell you.

92
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,400
Here's exactly what happened.

93
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,240
As soon as I walked in,

94
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,760
that guy stood up

95
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:23,280
and started blabbering about some "Borges" or whatever.

96
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,560
He started reciting poetry to me.

97
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,880
I was like, "Why are you reciting poetry?"

98
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,360
I didn't understand a word of it.

99
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,760
Trying to act like an intellectual with me.

100
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,360
I asked if his family runs a garbage dump.

101
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,880
He's so full of it!

102
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,280
You know what made me the maddest?

103
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,320
He brought up my Yangyang.

104
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,280
And what did he say?

105
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,000
He used my Yangyang to insult me!

106
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,480
I said, "You've crossed the line!"

107
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,480
That's when I grabbed him by the collar.

108
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,280
And at that moment,

109
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:43,760
people came from over here.

110
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,480
Then people came from over there, too.

111
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:49,040
A whole swarm of people showed up.

112
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,920
Right then, as I was grabbing his collar,

113
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,480
guess what I noticed?

114
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,960
His tie.

115
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:56,440
Did he think I don't know international brands?

116
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,360
What did it say? Armani?

117
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,480
I said, "What Armani?"

118
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,840
It wasn't Armani at all!

119
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,520
What Armani?

120
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,120
Let me tell you,

121
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,520
it was "Anima"!

122
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,320
What are you laughing at?

123
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,400
I'm telling you,

124
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,720
Sister Lan,

125
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,960
I'm so pissed off!

126
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:15,320
A matchmaker's words are nothing but lies!

127
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,200
Don't insult our profession.

128
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,160
My bad, my bad.

129
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:22,920
I just didn't pick a good one today.

130
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,680
Next time, I'll find you a great one.

131
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,600
No more blind dates!

132
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,360
I'm done with blind dates!

133
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:33,640
Zhang Lijuan,

134
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,880
are you and that A Min having a thing?

135
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,680
What thing? Nothing's going on.

136
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,800
Isn't it Yangyang's birthday today?

137
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:44,880
Oh, really?

138
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,000
Hurry up and get ready.

139
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,320
Come help me out.

140
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,560
A Min.

141
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,760
What are you doing?

142
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,720
Washing vegetables.

143
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,720
Lijuan,

144
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,040
I'm going upstairs to get something.

145
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,480
I'll be right down.

146
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,600
Here you go.

147
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,800
Um, getting so mad is bad for your health.

148
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,320
Have some water

149
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,560
and calm down.

150
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,560
Then I... I'll go wash the vegetables.

151
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,160
Here comes the fish!

152
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:19,920
Yangyang, this is my first time making braised fish.

153
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,000
I don't know if you'll like it.

154
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,560
I don't want any.

155
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:38,360
Yangyang, this poetry book is from me.

156
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,360
Happy birthday!

157
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,400
Thank you.

158
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,840
A Min.

159
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:48,080
Will you still read poems to me?

160
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,120
Of course.

161
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,920
You're my best friend.

162
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:55,560
Yangyang.

163
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,920
I made you some noodles.

164
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,760
Come on, eat them while they're hot.

165
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,640
I made them with two poached eggs today.

166
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,600
Eat up, eat up.

167
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:06,040
I'm not hungry yet.

168
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,520
I'll eat later.

169
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,520
This kid can't hide his feelings.

170
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,200
And Lan too.

171
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,560
She's usually so fast, but she's still not down here.

172
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,800
Wu Huilian, hurry down!

173
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:21,720
We're all waiting for you!

174
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,800
Hurry up!

175
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:23,720
Hurry!

176
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,000
Hurry!

177
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:28,720
Quick, quick!

178
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,360
Take a seat, have a seat.

179
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,520
Okay, alright.

180
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,880
Here, have something to drink.

181
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,840
Yiran.

182
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,720
Oh my god.

183
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,320
Bajie.

184
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,800
Eldest Brother, there are monsters ahead.

185
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:53,480
What do we do?

186
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,520
Watch me.

187
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,080
Okay.

188
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,080
Hey, birthday boy.

189
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,280
This is my birthday present to you.

190
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,680
From now on, whenever you're unhappy...

191
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,920
Or when you run into any trouble...

192
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:07,080
Just press this button.

193
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,720
And a superhero will come to your side.

194
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,680
To give you infinite energy.

195
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:14,000
That's great!

196
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,800
Thank you, Yiran.

197
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,040
Unmatched in wits.

198
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,600
Yangyang is the best!

199
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:24,040
I, old Sun, wish Yangyang a happy birthday!

200
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,200
It even talks!

201
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,840
Happy birthday, Yangyang.

202
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,160
Happy birthday.

203
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:32,760
Yangyang, I brought you a gift.

204
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,120
A gift for you.

205
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,440
Take it, see what it is.

206
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,960
This is Zhu Bajie.

207
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,080
Monkey King!

208
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,960
Sun Wukong.

209
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,240
Yangyang, do you like it?

210
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,720
I'm giving...

211
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,160
...this to you.

212
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,160
Happy birthday!

213
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:56,520
Thank you.

214
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,800
Yangyang!

215
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:00,160
Your godmother is here.

216
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,200
Lan is here.

217
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:05,920
Happy birthday to you!

218
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:12,800
Happy birthday to you!

219
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:18,920
Happy birthday to you!

220
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:21,000
Come on, make a wish.

221
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,440
Make a wish, make a wish.

222
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:25,640
Happy birthday to my big boy. Make a wish.

223
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,640
Happy birthday!

224
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:29,960
Yangyang, happy birthday.

225
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:33,640
Your godmother made this cake for you herself.

226
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,480
I can tell.

227
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,000
Look at all the flour on your face.

228
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,400
Let me tell you.

229
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,400
I've never even made a cake for your sister.

230
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,520
You know?

231
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,440
Give your godmother a kiss.

232
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:53,680
Eighteen years, it hasn't been easy.

233
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,000
Come on, take a seat.

234
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,120
Sit, sit, sit.

235
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:58,760
Sit down, please.

236
00:11:58,760 --> 00:11:59,440
Everyone, sit down.

237
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,760
Yangyang is happy.

238
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,240
Here.

239
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,600
This is for Yangyang.

240
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:20,960
Today is my 18th birthday.

241
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,200
Mom.

242
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,200
Thank you for everything.

243
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:33,800
I love you.

244
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:43,600
My birthday wish this year is...

245
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:46,120
For everyone to be together forever.

246
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:59,120
Okay.

247
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,680
Okay.

248
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,240
Come on.

249
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,520
Come on, come on.

250
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,160
Come on, come on.

251
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,960
Yangyang, happy birthday!

252
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:07,720
Happy birthday, Yangyang!

253
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:28,400
A slender figure, a floating figure

254
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:30,440
Silently turning around

255
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,800
Saying to me, romantic lover

256
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,120
Love me

257
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,200
Slow down, slow down.

258
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,960
It's not even your birthday.

259
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,360
Why are you so happy?

260
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,360
I'm happy for Zhang Lijuan.

261
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,680
Yeah.

262
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,600
Thinking back to when Yangyang was little,

263
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,800
he was so tiny, just learning to use chopsticks.

264
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:54,240
He couldn't get it right for months.

265
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,960
When he was ten,

266
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,520
he was still pooping his pants.

267
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,640
Your Aunt Juan had it rough.

268
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,280
If it were anyone else,

269
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:04,760
they'd have given up on this kid long ago.

270
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,840
Good thing Yangyang has grown up.

271
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,880
He's getting better and better.

272
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:11,360
Aunt Juan can finally rest easy.

273
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:17,000
Your Aunt Juan has had a tough life too.

274
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,360
You see,

275
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,520
she's so beautiful,

276
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:23,800
but she never even thought about herself.

277
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,960
So for a woman,

278
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,360
once she becomes a mother,

279
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,320
her heart

280
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,920
is completely filled with her child.

281
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:37,560
Yangyang is the apple of her eye.

282
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,160
Just like you.

283
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,800
You'll always be the apple of my eye too.

284
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,400
All right.

285
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,840
We're so happy today,

286
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,280
and things are getting better for everyone.

287
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,480
Don't get all sentimental on me,

288
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,960
Wu Huilian.

289
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:54,560
Yangyang, don't just eat.

290
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,480
Here.

291
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,080
Have some water.

292
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:59,040
Here, here, have some water.

293
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,480
Thanks, Mom.

294
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:16,760
Hello?

295
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,280
Jiang.

296
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:21,080
Zhang Lijuan, it's been three days.

297
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,080
Principal and interest,

298
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,280
that's 560,000 in total.

299
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,680
Do you have it ready?

300
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,040
Jiang,

301
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,720
could you give me a few more days?

302
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:33,520
My investment hasn't been redeemed yet.

303
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:34,840
Cut the crap.

304
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:37,040
You owe money, you pay it back.

305
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,480
By tomorrow.

306
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,080
Jiang... Hello?

307
00:16:56,440 --> 00:17:00,400
Sorry, the number you dialed is powered off.

308
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,120
What's going on?

309
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:08,120
Did something happen?

310
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:17,760
Ms. Wang,

311
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,440
it's Lijuan.

312
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,440
Oh, Lijuan.

313
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:23,000
It's been a while.

314
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,320
I wanted to ask you,

315
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,600
have you seen my brother lately?

316
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:28,960
Lijuan...

317
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:30,560
I was just about to tell you.

318
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:33,560
A few groups of people came looking for your brother recently.

319
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,040
They said he was gambling

320
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,440
and owes a lot of money.

321
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,320
Gambling?

322
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,440
Yeah.

323
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,520
They said it was gambling.

324
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:43,120
Then...

325
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,440
he...

326
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,240
where is he?

327
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:50,120
I heard he went on the run.

328
00:17:58,560 --> 00:17:59,280
Zhang Lijuan.

329
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:00,800
Jiang sent me to collect the money for him.

330
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,360
That's all I have for now.

331
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:21,200
Is this it?

332
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:23,080
Do you take me for a beggar?

333
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:25,120
This isn't even enough for a day's interest.

334
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:26,560
My money...

335
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,320
went into wealth management products.

336
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,560
I'll redeem it in a few days.

337
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:32,200
And I'll pay you right back.

338
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:35,960
Borrowing from others...

339
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:37,240
to make investments?

340
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:39,200
Must be a massive business!

341
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,240
Keep it down. Keep it down.

342
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,200
I can hear you.

343
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,240
I'll give you two more days.

344
00:18:58,840 --> 00:18:59,800
If you don't pay up,

345
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,720
you

346
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,360
and your son...

347
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,360
just wait and see.

348
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,120
Just wait and see!

349
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:13,160
It's okay. Don't be scared.

350
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,120
Zhang Lijuan, last night...

351
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,680
who were those guys?

352
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:27,880
Why were they so aggressive?

353
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,800
They're a renovation crew.

354
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:32,680
They even left their number here.

355
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:36,120
I was just thinking of renovating the shop.

356
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:40,080
Yangyang, what's wrong?

357
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,600
It's nothing.

358
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,200
Yangyang!

359
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,000
Look at this.

360
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:51,040
You made a mess everywhere again.

361
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:51,960
Let me do it. I got it.

362
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,040
Such a mess.

363
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:55,760
Did you need me for something?

364
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:57,160
Nothing much.

365
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:59,600
I was just in a good mood last night.

366
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:01,160
I drank too much again.

367
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,760
I'll get going if there's nothing else.

368
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:05,840
Alright.

369
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:07,440
Yangyang, you're a grown-up now.

370
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,680
Don't make your mom angry.

371
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,640
Bye, I'm heading out.

372
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,040
Mom...

373
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:20,240
Yangyang is scared.

374
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:23,000
Don't be scared. Yangyang, don't be scared.

375
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:23,560
It's okay.

376
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:25,440
Mom is here. Mom is right here.

377
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:03,200
Hello, the number you have dialed

378
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:36,640
Hello. The number you dialed is powered off.

379
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,440
Excuse me, sir.

380
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:48,600
Do you know why Lijuan Barbershop is closed today?

381
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:50,040
I haven't seen her today.

382
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:15,760
Mom, where are we going?

383
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,840
We're going away for a few days.

384
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:22,480
Where to?

385
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:24,960
When are we coming back?

386
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:26,120
You'll see when we get there.

387
00:22:37,760 --> 00:22:38,440
Let's go.

388
00:22:55,880 --> 00:22:56,960
A Min.

389
00:22:58,600 --> 00:22:59,720
What are you doing here?

390
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,440
I couldn't reach you.

391
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:09,160
So I figured something was wrong.

392
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,760
Uncle A Min...

393
00:23:12,760 --> 00:23:14,560
I don't want to go out and play.

394
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:15,880
It's okay, Yangyang.

395
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,320
I'm right here.

396
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:20,760
Don't cry. Don't be scared.

397
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:21,640
I'm right here.

398
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,160
Yangyang.

399
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:27,040
Mommy needs to talk to Uncle A Min.

400
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:38,880
Here's what happened.

401
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:42,440
Before the Spring Festival,

402
00:23:43,520 --> 00:23:45,240
my brother called me

403
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:50,520
and told me about some high-interest wealth management products.

404
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:55,240
I was too greedy.

405
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,480
I thought,

406
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,960
I just thought

407
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:08,800
about leaving a way out for Yangyang.

408
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:14,840
If we could really make some quick money, wouldn't that be great?

409
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:18,200
So I gave him all my savings.

410
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:22,240
I even mortgaged my house for him.

411
00:24:24,760 --> 00:24:26,440
How could I have known

412
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:29,720
there were no wealth management products at all?

413
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:34,200
He took all my money to gamble,

414
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:37,400
and lost it all.

415
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:42,920
I mortgaged my house,

416
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:46,360
and now I'm drowning in debt.

417
00:24:48,320 --> 00:24:50,680
I really had nowhere else to turn.

418
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:54,160
So I thought

419
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:57,240
I'd take Yangyang away to hide for a while.

420
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:04,360
I understand. It's okay.

421
00:25:05,520 --> 00:25:06,320
Well,

422
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,600
over the years,

423
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:11,200
I haven't been very good at saving money.

424
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:14,040
There's a little over 100,000 here.

425
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:15,240
You take it and use it first.

426
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:17,040
Pay off a part of it.

427
00:25:17,040 --> 00:25:17,320
This...

428
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,280
We'll figure out the rest later.

429
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,560
No, I can't take this.

430
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:20,560
Use it for the emergency.

431
00:25:21,600 --> 00:25:22,880
If the money's gone, we can earn it back.

432
00:25:23,520 --> 00:25:24,840
The most important thing is that you're safe.

433
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:33,200
I'll write you an IOU.

434
00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:35,480
Just get through this hurdle first.

435
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:38,880
As long as both of you are safe,

436
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:41,280
nothing else matters.

437
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:46,520
Yangyang.

438
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:49,000
Let's go home.

439
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:50,720
Come on.

440
00:25:52,520 --> 00:25:53,560
Mom,

441
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:56,840
do we not have to leave anymore?

442
00:25:59,320 --> 00:26:00,440
We're not leaving.

443
00:26:03,840 --> 00:26:04,800
Let's go home.

444
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,280
Here, give it to me.

445
00:26:07,280 --> 00:26:08,920
We're going home!

446
00:26:16,320 --> 00:26:17,400
Have you told Yangyang

447
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,560
about any of this?

448
00:26:20,600 --> 00:26:22,560
How could I possibly tell him?

449
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:24,920
I can't just say

450
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:28,080
that the Monkey King doesn't exist in this world,

451
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:29,960
and there are only endless monsters to fight, right?

452
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:32,920
The Monkey King

453
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,560
might not really exist.

454
00:26:34,560 --> 00:26:35,400
But,

455
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:38,480
I want to be with you both

456
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,960
to fight all the monsters together.

457
00:26:46,520 --> 00:26:48,240
Don't cause trouble!

458
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,160
Get the hell out of here!

459
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:50,440
What are you doing?

460
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:51,760
Are you all deaf?

461
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:58,360
Ermao, what's going on?

462
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:00,360
It looks like debt collectors.

463
00:27:00,360 --> 00:27:02,480
It seems Zhang Lijuan owes them a lot of money.

464
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:05,600
How could Aunt Juan owe them money?

465
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:06,360
I don't know.

466
00:27:06,360 --> 00:27:08,360
They look so fierce, I didn't dare ask.

467
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,240
Go call the police first.

468
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,280
I'll go take a look.

469
00:27:10,280 --> 00:27:11,080
Okay, okay, okay.

470
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:17,400
Little girl, step aside.

471
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,200
This has nothing to do with you.

472
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,080
We can talk this out, man.

473
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:20,320
What are you guys doing?

474
00:27:20,320 --> 00:27:21,800
She owes Jiang money.

475
00:27:21,800 --> 00:27:22,960
Are you going to pay for her?

476
00:27:24,320 --> 00:27:25,000
I... I...

477
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,640
Just listen to me for a second.

478
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:27,120
Pay up!

479
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:28,160
I really don't have any money.

480
00:27:28,600 --> 00:27:30,560
So you're resorting to violent debt collection, huh?

481
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:32,960
Either pay her debt or get lost!

482
00:27:36,320 --> 00:27:37,840
I see your idiot son is not bad.

483
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,480
Let's take him to busk!

484
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:42,280
Let go of me!

485
00:27:49,080 --> 00:27:49,720
Don't get physical!

486
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:51,320
I'm telling you, there are cameras everywhere!

487
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:54,080
If you don't pay today, I'll smash your shop!

488
00:27:57,800 --> 00:27:59,040
Yangyang is scared!

489
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:01,400
Yangyang is so scared!

490
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:05,680
Superman, come save Mom!

491
00:28:06,720 --> 00:28:07,960
Don't hit her!

492
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:11,160
I'll take him to busk right now!

493
00:28:12,560 --> 00:28:14,080
I'll fight you!

494
00:28:21,320 --> 00:28:22,560
Don't do this!

495
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:23,920
Juan!

496
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:25,440
Doing it the hard way, then!

497
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,480
You're asking for it!

498
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:41,080
Yiran!

499
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,040
We'll let it go for today.

500
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:45,840
Let's go!

501
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:47,480
You killed someone!

502
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:50,240
Yiran! Yiran!

503
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:51,600
Yiran, wake up!

504
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:52,360
Wake up!

505
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:54,880
These bastards!

506
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:56,040
These bastards beat someone up!

507
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:57,040
What are you doing?

508
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,880
None of your business.

509
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,120
Don't let them leave!

510
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,320
Put it down!

511
00:29:05,600 --> 00:29:07,760
Put it down! Put it down!

512
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,040
The police are here!

513
00:29:09,040 --> 00:29:09,880
Put it down!

514
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:10,600
The police are here!

515
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:13,280
Somebody, help!

516
00:29:13,280 --> 00:29:14,280
Yiran!

517
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,160
Yiran, don't scare Auntie Juan.

518
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:18,200
Yiran, wake up! Wake up!

519
00:30:11,760 --> 00:30:13,200
Eat a little something.

520
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:15,760
I'm not hungry.

521
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:23,120
Yiran.

522
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:23,880
You're here.

523
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:26,080
Daren, Lan.

524
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:27,960
Daren.

525
00:30:34,360 --> 00:30:36,120
Lan, Daren.

526
00:30:36,120 --> 00:30:37,440
Why don't you guys head back first?

527
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:38,840
Xiaofang and I will take care of her.

528
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:44,200
Buddha bless her.

529
00:30:45,760 --> 00:30:47,760
Yiran, please be okay.

530
00:30:47,760 --> 00:30:49,680
May Buddha keep her safe.

531
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:53,440
Buddha bless her.

532
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:55,520
Keep Yiran safe and sound.

533
00:30:55,520 --> 00:30:56,440
And healthy.

534
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,800
Yiran!

535
00:31:02,320 --> 00:31:04,760
Yiran.

536
00:31:08,840 --> 00:31:10,320
Don't move, don't move.

537
00:31:10,320 --> 00:31:12,640
The doctor says you have a concussion.

538
00:31:13,080 --> 00:31:14,560
How's Aunt Juan?

539
00:31:14,560 --> 00:31:16,120
You're way too reckless!

540
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,400
With so many big guys around,

541
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:19,840
why did you rush to the front?

542
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:21,280
Do you have a death wish or what?

543
00:31:21,280 --> 00:31:22,800
Yangyang already lost his dad.

544
00:31:24,640 --> 00:31:25,920
If he loses his mom too,

545
00:31:27,840 --> 00:31:29,560
what will happen to him?

546
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:31,880
You only think about other people.

547
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:35,120
Have you ever thought about if I lost you,

548
00:31:35,120 --> 00:31:36,160
what I would do?

549
00:31:41,320 --> 00:31:43,120
You scared me to death!

550
00:31:49,840 --> 00:31:52,840
Daren, why don't you take Lan back first?

551
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:54,680
My brother and I have it covered here.

552
00:31:55,120 --> 00:31:57,920
Yeah, plus we can't have too many people staying overnight.

553
00:31:57,920 --> 00:32:00,120
Leave the night shift to us.

554
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:02,680
Don't worry.

555
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:04,360
The kids are right.

556
00:32:04,960 --> 00:32:07,040
If you ruin your health staying up,

557
00:32:07,040 --> 00:32:08,640
how will you take care of Yiran?

558
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,480
All right, stop crying.

559
00:32:12,120 --> 00:32:13,080
I'm fine.

560
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:15,480
Xiaofang is here to take care of me.

561
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,920
All right.

562
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,200
I'll head back then.

563
00:32:26,040 --> 00:32:28,520
I need to... stay strong.

564
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:31,920
I'm leaving.

565
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,360
Here we go.

566
00:32:35,840 --> 00:32:37,400
I'll leave her to you.

567
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:37,760
Bye-bye.

568
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:38,640
Get some rest.

569
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,400
We're leaving.

570
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:49,200
It's okay.

571
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:51,680
I'll bring you some medicated patches later.

572
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:53,200
They'll help once you put them on.

573
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:56,840
How could she be so reckless?

574
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,880
Charging right to the front like that.

575
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:01,280
It scared me to death!

576
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,480
Who do you think she gets her guts from?

577
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:05,560
From you, obviously.

578
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:07,400
She's your flesh and blood.

579
00:33:08,840 --> 00:33:10,400
Of course she's my flesh and blood!

580
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,280
The thing is, when she was little,

581
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:14,880
she was terrified of pain.

582
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:16,920
When I took her to get a finger prick,

583
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,280
she cried her eyes out.

584
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:21,120
If only I had been there today.

585
00:33:21,120 --> 00:33:22,880
She wouldn't have taken that hit.

586
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:24,160
I would've rushed up...

587
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:29,600
And gone pow, pow?

588
00:33:30,120 --> 00:33:30,760
Oh, you.

589
00:33:30,760 --> 00:33:32,480
Do you think you're a superhero?

590
00:33:34,040 --> 00:33:36,480
All right, I know you're worried.

591
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:38,080
But the doctor said it,

592
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:41,160
she just has a mild concussion.

593
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,520
She can be discharged in a few days.

594
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:46,560
Why are you just standing there?

595
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:52,680
It breaks my heart.

596
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,360
I was scared to death today.

597
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,600
I was so afraid...

598
00:34:02,560 --> 00:34:05,200
that she wouldn't wake up again, just like Old Li.

599
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:07,800
Bite your tongue!

600
00:34:08,160 --> 00:34:09,480
What are you talking about?

601
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:12,440
Brother Daming.

602
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:14,200
That was Heaven being blind.

603
00:34:15,160 --> 00:34:17,280
Yiran has the Bodhisattva protecting her.

604
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,200
She'll be fine.

605
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:20,800
Chen Baixi.

606
00:34:22,320 --> 00:34:24,400
I need to talk to you.

607
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:28,600
About what?

608
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:30,520
I told you before

609
00:34:31,120 --> 00:34:34,640
about the man who abducted Xizi twenty years ago.

610
00:34:35,080 --> 00:34:35,760
I remember.

611
00:34:36,080 --> 00:34:38,280
Today at Aunt Juan's shop,

612
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:41,080
I think I saw him again.

613
00:34:43,240 --> 00:34:44,600
I suspect

614
00:34:46,200 --> 00:34:48,960
he might be the one who kidnapped Xizi.

615
00:34:52,200 --> 00:34:54,360
You're saying the guy who hit you today

616
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:56,200
is also the one who abducted Xizi?

617
00:34:56,200 --> 00:34:58,040
His appearance has changed,

618
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,720
but the tattoo on his right wrist...

619
00:35:01,720 --> 00:35:03,280
the 'Ren' tattoo.

620
00:35:04,120 --> 00:35:05,840
I see your idiot son is not bad.

621
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,200
Let's take him to busk!

622
00:35:07,720 --> 00:35:09,280
I saw it crystal clear.

623
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,240
Exactly the same.

624
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:14,640
Okay, I understand.

625
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,760
Xiaofang, you take care of her for now.

626
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:18,840
I'm going to the police station.

627
00:35:22,160 --> 00:35:22,840
Here.

628
00:35:24,520 --> 00:35:25,360
Have a drink.

629
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:38,120
Why is it that when Mom was in danger,

630
00:35:38,120 --> 00:35:41,360
Superman didn't come to save her?

631
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:43,560
Sister Yiran came instead.

632
00:35:43,560 --> 00:35:46,720
Could Sister Yiran be Superman?

633
00:35:49,960 --> 00:35:50,760
Yangyang,

634
00:35:51,720 --> 00:35:54,360
when you grow up one day

635
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,440
and become brave,

636
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,120
you'll become Superman too.

637
00:35:58,360 --> 00:35:59,840
Really, Uncle A Min?

638
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:00,880
Of course.

639
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:02,920
Yangyang is the best.

640
00:36:03,720 --> 00:36:04,200
Okay.

641
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:07,840
Mom!

642
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:10,720
You're back!

643
00:36:11,680 --> 00:36:12,560
How's Yiran?

644
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:16,240
She's awake.

645
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:19,040
It's just that I don't know

646
00:36:19,040 --> 00:36:21,360
if the kid will have any lasting effects.

647
00:36:21,720 --> 00:36:23,480
I don't even dare to face Sister Lan.

648
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,280
It's my fault.

649
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:27,440
If I had been here today, none of this would have happened.

650
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:30,000
Don't say that.

651
00:36:31,200 --> 00:36:33,960
No one could have foreseen something like this.

652
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:38,000
Enough about that. I'll clean up the shop.

653
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:38,640
Mom,

654
00:36:38,640 --> 00:36:41,600
Uncle A Min already cleaned it up.

655
00:36:50,040 --> 00:36:50,760
Thank you.

656
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,160
It's nothing.

657
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:54,480
You guys haven't eaten, right?

658
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:55,640
No.

659
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:56,640
We haven't.

660
00:36:57,600 --> 00:37:00,320
Then I'll go make something to eat.

661
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:07,080
Yangyang, Mom is back.

662
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,160
Come on, let's go eat.

663
00:37:11,200 --> 00:37:12,520
Oh, Old Li...

664
00:37:13,560 --> 00:37:15,760
I was almost scared to death.

665
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:21,360
My heart today...

666
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,720
has been in my throat all day.

667
00:37:27,520 --> 00:37:28,760
You know what?

668
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,920
That kid, Yiran,

669
00:37:35,080 --> 00:37:37,680
is very loyal and brave.

670
00:37:39,240 --> 00:37:41,600
If your spirit is in heaven, you must bless her.

671
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,840
You must keep her safe.

672
00:37:46,080 --> 00:37:48,440
Nothing bad can ever happen to her again.

673
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:53,240
Please bless her.

674
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,640
Brother-in-law.

675
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:11,440
What exactly are you thinking?

676
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:16,720
I'm talking to you.

677
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:21,200
My dear brother-in-law.

678
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:24,800
Zhuang Qiang has chased you to your doorstep and won't let up.

679
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:25,720
Yet you don't say a word.

680
00:38:26,200 --> 00:38:29,280
Anyone can see that you two...

681
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:32,240
yet you two just won't cross that line.

682
00:38:32,240 --> 00:38:34,040
I'm getting anxious just watching you.

683
00:38:38,720 --> 00:38:41,200
Making yourself at home is really paying off.

684
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:42,920
You even have time to worry about others.

685
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:45,880
That has nothing to do with it.

686
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:48,000
Auntie Huilian was absolutely right about one thing.

687
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:51,360
A man should take the initiative.

688
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:52,680
Taking the initiative is how you get results.

689
00:39:05,240 --> 00:39:06,040
Yiran,

690
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,320
Not a care in the world.

691
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,240
Fell asleep so fast.

692
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,520
And snoring so loud.

693
00:39:24,520 --> 00:39:25,320
You really are something.

694
00:39:37,320 --> 00:39:38,320
Wu Huilian

695
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:46,880
Is it sweet?

696
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:49,360
Yiran.

697
00:39:50,360 --> 00:39:51,240
Aunt Juan.

698
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:52,800
You're here.

699
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:54,920
Are you guys okay after that?

700
00:39:57,280 --> 00:40:00,640
Aunt Juan made you some pigeon soup.

701
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:03,880
It's good for your blood.

702
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:04,920
Are you feeling better?

703
00:40:04,920 --> 00:40:05,920
Much better.

704
00:40:07,120 --> 00:40:08,440
You scared me to death.

705
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:16,200
Lan.

706
00:40:19,160 --> 00:40:21,600
Wu Huilian, don't give me that.

707
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,880
Stay out of our business.

708
00:40:29,960 --> 00:40:30,960
Lan.

709
00:40:35,520 --> 00:40:36,600
It's my fault.

710
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:39,440
I was too greedy.

711
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:43,360
I just wanted to make some quick money.

712
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:49,600
I didn't expect to lose all my savings.

713
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:52,360
And end up in deep debt.

714
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:55,000
Serves you right. You asked for it.

715
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:58,360
Aren't you supposed to be smart?

716
00:40:58,360 --> 00:41:00,480
You're usually so good with numbers.

717
00:41:01,280 --> 00:41:03,520
But you lose your mind when it matters most.

718
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,680
I swear, your whole life...

719
00:41:05,680 --> 00:41:08,360
You work day and night, pinching pennies.

720
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:10,320
Finally making some hard-earned money.

721
00:41:11,200 --> 00:41:13,160
And you just give it away to others.

722
00:41:13,160 --> 00:41:14,480
How generous of you.

723
00:41:15,200 --> 00:41:17,560
And you got our Yiran hit on the head.

724
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,240
Why bring that up?

725
00:41:21,320 --> 00:41:22,280
Aunt Juan, I'm fine.

726
00:41:22,280 --> 00:41:22,920
I really am fine.

727
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:23,960
I didn't want this either!

728
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:25,800
Don't you cry in front of me.

729
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:28,000
Don't ever contact me again.

730
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,440
I never want to see you again.

731
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:32,160
Lan, please don't.

732
00:41:32,160 --> 00:41:34,040
Why don't you hit me?

733
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:41,360
Go ahead and hit me too.

734
00:41:41,360 --> 00:41:43,480
Give me a concussion too.

735
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:50,080
I swear...

736
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:52,800
Hit me.

737
00:41:54,680 --> 00:41:56,840
I really want to beat you to death.

738
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:59,280
How could you not tell me about something this big?

739
00:42:00,040 --> 00:42:02,120
Do you even see me as your best friend?

740
00:42:03,040 --> 00:42:05,120
What... what is this?

741
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:06,880
Take this and pay off your debts first.

742
00:42:15,160 --> 00:42:16,240
I can't take this.

743
00:42:20,120 --> 00:42:23,160
We've known each other for almost twenty years.

744
00:42:24,320 --> 00:42:26,800
Your brain really never works, does it?

745
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:30,080
Deceived by men when you were young.

746
00:42:30,320 --> 00:42:33,440
And at this age, you get scammed by your own brother.

747
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:35,960
You have to take this money.

748
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:38,360
If you don't take it,

749
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:40,800
I'll never speak to you again.

750
00:42:50,240 --> 00:42:51,200
Lan...

751
00:42:55,040 --> 00:42:57,080
You really don't treat me like family.

752
00:42:58,320 --> 00:42:59,480
And you have the nerve to cry.

753
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:01,080
Alright, alright.

754
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:03,800
Make some fish head soup tomorrow.

755
00:43:03,800 --> 00:43:04,600
Look at us.

756
00:43:04,600 --> 00:43:05,400
Yiran has a concussion.

757
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:06,440
Your brain isn't working right.

758
00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:08,800
And I've been out of touch with society for too long.

759
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:10,320
My brain hasn't been upgraded yet.

760
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:17,440
Hurry up and feed the pigeon soup to Yiran.

761
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:18,400
Go on, hurry.

762
00:43:28,040 --> 00:43:29,080
Drink your soup.

763
00:44:00,120 --> 00:44:00,720
Dad.

764
00:44:02,000 --> 00:44:03,120
Why are you at the hospital?

765
00:44:03,120 --> 00:44:03,920
Are you sick?

766
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:07,520
What's wrong?

767
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:12,400
Just my hemorrhoids acting up these past few days.

768
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:13,360
It's nothing.

769
00:44:13,880 --> 00:44:15,440
A couple of patches and I'll be fine.

770
00:44:15,880 --> 00:44:17,200
This much medicine for hemorrhoids?

771
00:44:19,040 --> 00:44:20,400
Just to have it on hand.

772
00:44:21,560 --> 00:44:23,720
Are you delivering food to Yiran?

773
00:44:24,280 --> 00:44:26,040
Then hurry up and go.

774
00:44:26,040 --> 00:44:27,960
Don't let her go hungry.

775
00:44:28,480 --> 00:44:29,680
I know, I know.

776
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:31,760
Let me call you a cab to go back then.

777
00:44:31,760 --> 00:44:35,200
No need. Why waste the money?

778
00:44:35,520 --> 00:44:37,400
There's a bus right outside.

779
00:44:38,320 --> 00:44:39,440
I'll get going now.

780
00:44:42,320 --> 00:44:43,400
Take care then.

781
00:45:07,680 --> 00:45:08,800
What are you doing here?

782
00:45:08,920 --> 00:45:10,360
I'm here to see my baby.

783
00:45:10,360 --> 00:45:11,440
Mind your own business.

784
00:45:14,840 --> 00:45:16,680
Ever heard of first come, first served?

785
00:45:16,680 --> 00:45:18,000
Nope.

786
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:19,200
Yiran!

787
00:45:22,600 --> 00:45:24,360
You little punk! Playing dirty, huh?

788
00:45:27,560 --> 00:45:28,400
Let me in!

789
00:45:29,040 --> 00:45:29,880
Let you in?!

790
00:45:33,360 --> 00:45:34,040
You little punk!

791
00:45:36,560 --> 00:45:38,120
I'm blocking with an Ace. Can you beat it?

792
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:42,000
That'll teach you to fight me.

793
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:43,040
Four twos! Bomb!

794
00:45:45,800 --> 00:45:46,800
Can you beat that?

795
00:45:47,520 --> 00:45:48,560
Let you in?!

796
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:51,840
Two Jokers!
